Reference implementations inspected:
- hiresTI, yelanxin/hiresTI (GPL-3.0): browser PKCE flow, device-code
  fallback, quality selection, library pagination and discovery page behavior.
- LMS TIDAL plugin, michaelherger/lms-plugin-tidal: REST routes, home feed,
  playlist collection shape, index-based editing and ETag requirements.
- python-tidal (tidalapi) 0.8.11, Thomas Amland and contributors: the public
  PKCE and device application identities and the token requests.

Media decoding: Symphonia FLAC decoder (symphonia-bundle-flac and
symphonia-core 0.5, MPL-2.0). No provider code is added to the Chilpa host.
